WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.720
Yeah.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.740
Deadline

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.430
I'm using a good hand.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:01.880
I heard it again.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.930
Don't be scared.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:09.410
I've already removed all the main parts and removed the line.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:20.360
I just activated the sound module with some cover.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.000
to take care of the underage students.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:07.110
Everyone in the first grade, listen to your older brother and sister and don't get lost.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.990
Hey everyone, what should we ride first? Magic Train!

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:14.210
It's a rocket coaster!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.000
Taku Fujimoto, right?

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.690
I'll ride with you.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.260
What do you want to ride on?

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.460
I don't want to ride anything.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.350
Then, do you want to eat something?

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.610
How about ice cream or crepe?

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.430
I don't want to eat.

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:48.120
It's a long-awaited party, isn't it?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.790
He's gone.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.020
He didn't say anything to me.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:54.180
He was so close to me.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:56.950
Who?

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:11.620
I'm not feeling well, but do you know what happened?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:16.890
The "Nakayoshi Robot" is gone.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.860
Dad said that it was stolen.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:22.480
There are many such incidents these days.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:28.070
Bad people will split it up and take only the parts that will be money and sell it.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.950
Then, your robot will also...

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.980
Ran, ran, ran...

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.960
Drive, drive...

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.980
Ran, ran...

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.300
Aru, where did you go?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.690
I would like you to consider the manual

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.800
It's something I've never seen before

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.450
What is this?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.890
It's like a combination of various robots.

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:09.920
Access to the main computer of the robot management center!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.420
Yes!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.600
From this video, the year of manufacture.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.700
Please give me your registration number.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:16.580
I got it!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.240
It's getting bigger and bigger!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:36.520
The more you touch it, the more you get into your body, and it's getting bigger and bigger!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.400
An amusement park is on the way!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.120
What?

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.360
Please evacuate immediately.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.080
This is Metro City Police Station.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.330
Everyone in the park...

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.350
Everyone, this way!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.150
Hurry up!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:30.870
Woo!

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.210
Mucho!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.040
Who are you?

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.480
Why did you do such a thing?

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:23.920
The enemy is ready!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:27.160
Wait, wait a minute!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.700
That's...

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:29.920
Dom is here!

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.050
I'm Atom!

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:34.130
What's your name?

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:02.040
We've received an answer from the computer.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.080
We'll switch to the main monitor.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.730
It's the date of manufacture and the registration number.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:10.680
As far as I know, there are 168 of them.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:14.680
168 robots are making that monster.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:18.680
Looking at this data, they're all old robots.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:23.300
Most of them are robots with a search wish or an escape message.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.240
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:30.000
Maybe it's something that was in the hands of the dark robot workers.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:37.640
It's a dark industry that breaks down the robots and takes out only the necessary parts, and then throws them all away.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:45.730
Yes. It is believed that the remains of the robots have been collected.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:52.760
Anyway, let's find out who this robot in the center is!

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.810
He disappeared into the ground!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.630
Atom? What's wrong with Atom?

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:39.030
Along with the monster, he fell into the ruins of a mine that had been closed a long time ago.

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:41.880
It's at the bottom of a 150-meter-deep vertical mine.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.470
What the...

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:47.550
Moreover, the ground is loose, and if you get too close, there's a risk of falling.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.140
Atom?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.250
We don't know what's going on.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:55.970
Anyway, we have no choice but to wait until he comes out.

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:56.980
What?

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.770
This is a video of your memory circuit, isn't it?

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:39.870
That girl is...

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.810
Taku-kun!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:58.320
What?

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.260
This is QF65-177.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:10.860
It's a robot for driving a car made for the general household.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:11.910
Look for it right away!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:37.400
Aru. That's what he was called, and this robot worked in the same house for more than 10 years.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:40.320
According to what I heard, Aru was the only child in the house.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:44.200
He was 7 years old and was sent to school.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:47.670
He did everything around him.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:53.460
Apparently, his parents left the child to Aru.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:30.000
And about 10 days ago, my parents...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.990
We've received the message that he's been abducted.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.300
It must be the doing of a spy.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:41.460
They probably abducted Al, took out the parts, and threw them away somewhere.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:45.900
It turned into some kind of cover.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:52.410
And the self-repair circuit must be out of order.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.410
Officer Tawashi.

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:54.650
Hm?

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.560
Robots that cause accidents always have circumstances.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.000
This Al is no exception.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:04.220
You're a victim.

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.220
Do you mean to say that you'll put your heart into it?

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:08.590
I'm not kidding.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.590
This monster attacked a car that had nothing to do with it.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.590
He injured a person at the construction site of the dam.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.480
He destroyed the amusement park.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.160
I can't forgive you for that sin.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.160
No matter what the reason is, I won't forgive you.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.220
But...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:25.030
Officer...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.260
I have to report this to the professor.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:49.140
I'm always with you.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:30.000
Metro City! Metro City! Change the strategy! All attacks are allowed!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.380
Magretta is not a police officer!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.970
