00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:34.450
It can't be helped!

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.950
I have the obligation to protect the lives of 10 million citizens!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.160
P-Police officer...

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:35.030
It's dangerous! Please be careful! It's dangerous!

