もう、ぼろぼろに壊れても、まだ一かけらの心が残っていた。

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.390
I'll do my best to repair it at the Academy of Science and Technology.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:34.390
That's right.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:35.280
Yeah.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:36.280
